<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1721454115"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:11.587"><div begin="15.162" end="45.055" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="15.162" end="22.864" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.162" end="17.631">一件黑色毛</span><span begin="17.631" end="18.779">衣</span> <span begin="19.237" end="21.680">两个人的回</span><span begin="21.680" end="22.864">忆</span></p><p begin="23.296" end="31.479" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.296" end="24.758">雨过之</span><span begin="24.758" end="25.308">后</span> <span begin="25.308" end="25.607">更</span><span begin="25.607" end="26.352">难</span><span begin="26.352" end="26.639">忘</span><span begin="26.639" end="28.516">记</span> <span begin="29.116" end="29.839">忘记我</span><span begin="29.839" end="30.346">还</span><span begin="30.346" end="30.917">爱</span><span begin="30.917" end="31.479">你</span></p><p begin="31.942" end="39.737" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.942" end="33.940">你不用在</span><span begin="33.940" end="35.097">意</span> <span begin="35.390" end="36.943">流泪也</span><span begin="36.943" end="37.879">只是</span><span begin="37.879" end="38.871">刚好</span><span begin="38.871" end="39.281">而</span><span begin="39.281" end="39.737">已</span></p><p begin="40.072" end="45.055" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.072" end="41.540">我早已</span><span begin="41.540" end="42.047">经</span><span begin="42.047" end="42.602">待</span><span begin="42.602" end="42.851">在</span><span begin="42.851" end="43.439">谷</span><span begin="43.439" end="45.055">底</span></p></div><div begin="46.129" end="1:01.425" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="46.129" end="54.398" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.129" end="46.633">我知</span><span begin="46.633" end="47.183">道</span><span begin="47.183" end="47.705">不</span><span begin="47.705" end="47.938">能</span><span begin="47.938" end="48.731">再</span><span begin="48.731" end="49.015">留</span><span begin="49.015" end="49.523">住</span><span